    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/README.md",
      "directive": "The workflow refuses changes to `_build-plan/`, the immutable shell, `atlas/current.json`, `state/live-set.json`, `releases/current-v5.json`, PipelineNews or Companies. It never promotes a pointer and never creates a full application copy. A failed proof is committed as evidence and the same stage retries later."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
