    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "The index must be hash-pinned to `data/repd_projects_202608290716.parquet`, whose expected SHA-256 is `174040c37f3d63742d6fdd7af722a8cfdf3fb53de3ff85ff1142d22fdac4866b`. It is data, not a full app. Cartridge installation remains blocked until the reviewed anchored patch and spec arrive under `DRAFT-CARTRIDGES/`."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "- Static exact-ref lookup must work on constrained devices without starting DuckDB."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "The immutable shell has four script slots: the bridge is taken, search is taken, the engine is forbidden, and the pre-snapped config adapter is the one remaining slot. A future window-intelligence cartridge must be composite and reproduce `snap: false` for 400/275/220/132/66 kV before adding any layer. It must insert the Funding Window group first so it is visible on iPad portrait without scrolling. Failure of its data or manifest must add zero window layers while leaving the core map unchanged."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "- C5 Companies candidate search Parquet; never draw it."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "- C12 GB electricity HUD, must carry as-of/stale state."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "CVAA has 24 vaccines and a reusable pinned workflow, but no consumer repository directly calls it. GridAtlas re-implements some antibodies inline. Adoption must be pinned to reviewed commit `d2ebc01f6eab41f2a84b0c53c4cfae0d2625ec5e`, measure actual findings first, then create a short-dated ratchet baseline. Do not install predicted maxima as if measured. Adding an inoculate workflow requires updating GridAtlas `ACTIVE_WORKFLOWS` in the same commit."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "This is dependency-free arithmetic over the frozen 7,680-project PipelineNews spine. For projects with both planning permission and construction dates, compute `under_construction - planning_permission_granted`, then median by technology and capacity band. A cell with fewer than 30 samples is NULL, not guessed. The estimate remains derived and must publish sample size."
    },
    {
      "ref": "origin/main",
      "path": "202608310050-gridatlas-next-version-builders/inputs/202608310015-attached-sample-findings.md",
      "directive": "The shipped product calls postcodes.io and Nominatim without source cards. REPD's card is still unstudied. Needed cards also include PlanIt, planning.data.gov.uk, The Gazette, LCCC, Companies House bulk and Companies House REST. A draft card is not approval: licence, attribution, rate limits, allowed use and last-checked date must be reviewed before a source becomes declared truth."
    },
